| Attainment leader alone on unsaturated receivers | The x-charge obstruction prevents the proposed lambda-power certificate. Keeping the full nonzero-Jacobian condition returns to the harder system. |
| Constant-exponent K16 radical certificates | THICK forces the exponent to grow with N. Finite examples do not establish an all-N identity. |
| K16 leading-degree balance / free-jet continuation | Leading balance is consistent at every degree; the free coefficient list grows. Neither argument bounds actual degree. |

A negative result closes its stated mechanism and hypotheses, not every
approach using the same mathematical vocabulary.

