+## Reranked bottlenecks and attacks
+
+### Proof side
+
+1. **Uniform contact-divisor capacity with an actual source attachment (avenues 1+29, then 2).** F9 succeeded because source normalization fixed the root profile, the reference theorem fixed `F_j=K C`, and local consumers forced more divisor into `C` than its degree allowed. The global bottleneck is to determine whether this is a scalable inequality or an F9 numerical coincidence. A universal statement must retain target order, factor multiplicities, coalesced/separated regimes, every scalar kernel, and actual source provenance.
+2. **Cofinal source/landing control (avenues 2+1+6+25).** Even a reusable local consumer is useless without a theorem placing every counterexample in a typed profile. `G2-PSC`, full Sigray landing/off-axis coverage, `G2-BD`, and an absolute type/degree ceiling remain distinct. The conditional maximum-125 theorem improves the finite floor, not this cofinal obligation.
