+2. **Avenues 31+32+36:** complete guarded source-ideal properness remains logically decisive, and a proper finite rational ideal needs no rational point. Operationally it is demoted because every charged recent client is retired and the secant three-generator identity supplies no degree/support bound. A new exact source must precede any search.
+3. **Avenue 4:** D-series non-algebraization is a useful falsification laboratory, but modular nonemptiness and compatible finite depths do not give a polynomial map. Use it to kill proposed compactness principles, not to report a counterexample.
+
+The strongest honest disproof attack is therefore the polar-divisor/`A_infinity` comparison, conditional on first freezing its exact tower state. A proof that the valuation increments eventually leave every finite polynomial-gauge cone would stop that construction; a bounded periodic valuation class with an algebraization theorem would be genuine counterexample-side progress. Anything between those outcomes is only tower data.
