+- **Outcome meanings:** if `[U_D]` is torsion/principal modulo no extra boundary, the principal pullback relation contradicts the infinite-order boundary lattice and excludes `d2=3`; if a correction has a forced sign or independent class, it may still strengthen the obstruction; if arbitrary boundary classes occur, the mechanism is refuted at this scope and the cubic lane stops; if the marked sheet fails to globalize, record that as the exact first failing arrow.
